---
import AppShot from './AppShot.astro';
import sendBack from '../../assets/app/send-back-dark.png';
import { PRODUCT_NAME } from '../../config';
---
<section class="s wrap rule fs" id="unblock" data-name="Send back" aria-labelledby="u-h">
  <div class="feat">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2 id="u-h">Send stuck work back <span class="soft">in two keystrokes.</span></h2>
      <p>When a PR conflicts or fails CI, {PRODUCT_NAME} says why in plain words. It also writes the prompt for you: which files, which PR on main touched them, which check failed and the last lines of its log. Copy it and paste it to whichever agent you use.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Templates for conflicts and CI failures, per repo</li>
        <li>Or post it as a PR comment, for agents that watch their PRs</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <AppShot src={sendBack} alt="The Send back sheet for a stuck pull request: why it is stuck and the prompt to copy for its agent" />
  </div>
</section>
